flowchart LR
    A[Generate random\nSimpleDocument] --> B[Convert to\nTomlValue]
    B --> C[Serialize via\nto_string]
    C --> D[Parse back via\n@toml.parse]
    D --> E[Convert back to\nSimpleDocument]
    E --> F{Original ==\nRoundtripped?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Pass]
    F -->|No| H[Shrink & retry]
    H --> A
